SUMMARY:Woodworking Workshops for Womaen
DESCRIPTION:Woodworking Workshops for Women\nThe two-day class covers in t
 he fundamentals of furniture making\, using time-honored joinery\, taught 
 in a supportive shop environment with a maximum of 12 students. We will be
 gin building a bench that can be used as seating for up to 2 people or as 
 a small table.\n-Learn to use traditional woodworking hand tools\; chisels
 \, dovetail saws\, bench and block planes\, drills.\n-Make mortise and ten
 on joinery with tusk wedges and foxtail wedges.\n-Develop the skills and u
 nderstand the process of building furniture with traditional joinery.\n\n-
 The focus of the class is learning joinery and developing hand tool skills
 .\n-Please note you may not finish the bench in one weekend. You can compl
 ete it at home or join another class as an ongoing student ($120- a day).\
 nClass fee is $325- plus a $35- materials fee ($360- total). All tools are
  supplied.\n\nClasses are Saturday\, 10am to 5pm and Sunday 10am-4pm.\nThe
  instructor is Debey Zito\, a professional furniture maker and interior de
 signer\, who has been designing\, building and teaching furniture making f
 or over 40 years.\n\nThe studio is in Sebastopol\, one hour north of the G
 olden Gate Bridge.\nExamples of our furniture can be seen at: [www.zitosch
 mittdesign.com](https://us4.mailchimp.com/mctx/clicks?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww
 .zitoschmittdesign.com&xid=800619c018&uid=7670861&iid=4b1b8d7005&pool=cts&
 v=2&c=1789842080&h=a73b7b60693348fad27c2c793fd7445eb375cbc7154212db8264385
 ae052a01e)\n\nIf you would like to read more about us:\n[www.pressdemocrat
 .com/lifestyle/3326278-181/sebastopol-woman-creates-magic-in](https://us4.
 mailchimp.com/mctx/clicks?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.pressdemocrat.com%2Flifesty
 le%2F3326278-181%2Fsebastopol-woman-creates-magic-in&xid=800619c018&uid=76
 70861&iid=4b1b8d7005&pool=cts&v=2&c=1789842080&h=342d74974e9252ac47318c33e
